    "content": "<p style=\"text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600\">96 Compliance Guides</p> <h1>AI Compliance by Sector & Regulation</h1> <p class=\"lead\">Practical compliance mappings between industry sectors and AI regulations. Each guide links a published control set to specific requirements. The mappings are indicative reference material; the signed crosswalk covers four regimes (EU, UK, Illinois SB 315, TC260) and we enforce nothing \u2014 only a regulator can.</p> <div class=\"grid\" id=\"grid\"></div>  <p class=\"foot\">© 2026 CSOAI LTD (UK 16939677) · <a href=\"/guides\">Methodology</a> · <a href=\"/audit\">ASSTI Benchmark</a></p>",
