    "css": "\n.legacy-content :root{--ink:#0f172a;--muted:#5a5e66;--gold:#c9a84c;--card:#f7f8fa;--border:#e6e8ec;--brand:#0a8a3f;--warn:#dc2626;--accent:#fef3c7}\n.legacy-content *{box-sizing:border-box}\n.legacy-content body{font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;max-width:980px;margin:2.5rem auto;padding:0 1.5rem;color:var(--ink);line-height:1.65}\n.legacy-content nav.crumbs{font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:1.5rem}\n.legacy-content nav.crumbs a{color:var(--brand);text-decoration:none}\n.legacy-content h1{margin:0 0 .5rem;font-size:2.1rem;letter-spacing:-.02em;line-height:1.2}\n.legacy-content h2{margin-top:2.5rem;margin-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--brand);padding-bottom:.4rem;font-size:1.4rem}\n.legacy-content h3{margin-top:1.5rem;margin-bottom:.3rem;font-size:1.05rem;color:var(--ink)}\n.legacy-content a{color:var(--brand);text-decoration:none}\n.legacy-content a:hover{text-decoration:underline}\n.legacy-content .lead{color:var(--muted);font-size:1.1rem;max-width:760px;margin-top:.75rem}\n.legacy-content .meta-bar{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:.5rem;margin:1rem 0 0;align-items:center}\n.legacy-content .tag{background:var(--card);color:var(--muted);padding:.25rem .7rem;border-radius:.3rem;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:500;border:1px solid var(--border)}\n.legacy-content .alert{background:#fef3c7;border-left:4px solid #d97706;padding:1rem 1.25rem;margin:1.5rem 0;border-radius:.35rem;color:#78350f}\n.legacy-content .alert strong{color:#92400e}\n.legacy-content .mcp-tag{display:inline-block;background:#dcfce7;color:#14532d;font-size:.72rem;padding:.2rem .55rem;border-radius:.3rem;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.05em;margin:.15rem .15rem .15rem 0}\n.legacy-content .requirement-box{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:.55rem;padding:1.1rem 1.25rem;margin:1rem 0}\n.legacy-content .requirement-box h3{margin-top:0;font-size:1rem}\n.legacy-content .requirement-box p{margin:.3rem 0;font-size:.92rem;color:var(--muted)}\n.legacy-content .cta{background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--brand) 0%,#076a30 100%);color:white;padding:1.5rem;border-radius:.55rem;margin:2rem 0;text-align:center}\n.legacy-content .cta h2{color:white;border:none;margin-top:0;padding-bottom:.3rem}\n.legacy-content .cta a{background:white;color:var(--brand);padding:.55rem 1.25rem;border-radius:.35rem;display:inline-block;margin:.3rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none}\n.legacy-content .cta a:hover{background:#f0fdf4;text-decoration:none}\n.legacy-content .foot{margin-top:3rem;color:#888;font-size:.85rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:1.5rem}\n.legacy-content ul.articles{margin:.5rem 0 1rem;padding-left:1.2rem}\n.legacy-content ul.articles li{margin:.35rem 0;font-size:.95rem}\n",
    "content": "<div style='display:flex;gap:.5rem;margin-bottom:.5rem'><span class='tag'>United Kingdom</span> <span class='tag'>2024</span></div>\n<h1>Insurance AI Compliance: UK AI Regulation</h1>\n<p class='lead'>UK insurance AI falls under the FCA's and PRA's remit, with additional ICO oversight for data protection. The sector-based approach means insurers must align AI governance with existing conduct, prudential, and financial-promotion rules.</p>\n\n<div class='meta-bar'>\n  <span class='tag'><strong>Sector:</strong> Insurance</span>\n  <span class='tag'><strong>Regulation:</strong> UK AI Regulation</span>\n  <span class='tag'><strong>CSOAI Articles:</strong> 4 mapped</span>\n</div>\n\n<h2>Key Compliance Requirements</h2>\n<div class='requirement-box'><h3>FCA guidance on AI in insurance</h3><p>The FCA expects insurers to ensure AI-driven pricing and claims decisions are fair, transparent, and do not produce unfairly discriminatory outcomes for protected groups.</p></div>\n<div class='requirement-box'><h3>Consumer Duty & AI fairness</h3><p>The Consumer Duty requires insurers to demonstrate that AI systems deliver fair value and good outcomes for retail customers, with evidence of testing and monitoring.</p></div>\n<div class='requirement-box'><h3>SMCR accountability for AI models</h3><p>Senior managers remain accountable for AI-driven decisions in their areas, including model risk, data ethics, and customer outcomes.</p></div>\n<div class='requirement-box'><h3>ICO guidance on insurance data & AI</h3><p>The ICO expects DPIAs for AI processing sensitive personal data, with transparency about automated decisions and provision for human review.</p></div>\n\n<h2>CSOAI Charter Articles</h2>\n<ul class='articles'>\n<li>Article 29 — Partnership Charter</li>\n<li>Article 33 — Transparency Obligations</li>\n<li>Article 47 — Audit Right</li>\n<li>Article 13 — Risk Management</li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2>Relevant MCPs</h2>\n<p style='color:var(--muted);font-size:.9rem'>These MCP servers operationalise compliance for this sector and regulation:</p>\n<span class='mcp-tag'>csoai-uk-ai-reg</span> <span class='mcp-tag'>csoai-deployer-pack</span> <span class='mcp-tag'>csoai-rms</span> \n\n<h2>Framework Reference</h2>\n<p>See the full <a href='/frameworks/uk-ai-regulation'>UK AI Regulation crosswalk</a> for the published clause-by-clause mappings. The signed crosswalk covers four regimes; anything outside them is described, not crosswalked.</p>\n\n<div class='cta'>\n  <h2>Run the free risk classifier</h2>\n  <p style='color:#e6f7ec;margin:.5rem 0'>The free self-serve tool is an EU AI Act risk classifier: describe the system in text and a deterministic decision table returns the Annex III tier and the gaps against a fixed Art 9–15/50 control set. It covers one regulation, it never contacts your system, and it is not a bench run. A GSPC bench run against a frozen bank is arranged directly and is not yet self-serve.</p>\n  <a href='/certify'>Get Measured &rarr;</a>\n  <a href='/asti'>See AI Self-State Index</a>\n  <a href='/frameworks'>All Frameworks</a>\n</div>\n\n<p class='foot'>&copy; 2026 CSOAI LTD &middot; UK Companies House <strong>16939677</strong><br>\nSector crosswalk &middot; CC BY 4.0 &middot; <a href='/methodology'>Methodology</a> &middot; <a href='mailto:nicholas@csoai.org'>Contact</a><br>\n<em>\"The ISO for AI safety.\"</em></p>",
