    "content": "<p class=\"breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">CSOAI</a> · <a href=\"/frameworks\">Frameworks</a> · <a href=\"/frameworks/nis2\">NIS2</a> · Legal & Law Firms</p> <p style=\"text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;font-size:.78rem;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:.5rem;font-weight:600\">Sector Compliance</p> <h1>Legal & Law Firms AI Compliance: NIS2</h1> <p class=\"lead\">Legal & Law Firms organisations using AI must comply with NIS2. Contract review, litigation support and legal research AI. Network and Information Security Directive. Expands scope to important entities across all sectors.. CSOAI publishes a signed crosswalk and signed measurement records with public verify URLs for NIS2. The published crosswalk covers four regimes (EU, UK, Illinois SB 315, TC260) at /crosswalk/east-west-v1.json; mappings beyond those four are described rather than crosswalked.</p> <h2>Key NIS2 Requirements for Legal & Law Firms</h2> <div class=\"req-box\"><h4>Article 21 — Cybersecurity Risk Management</h4><p>CSOAI maps this to charter articles. The mapping is indicative and published; the signed, article-level crosswalk runs in the OS.</p></div> <div class=\"req-box\"><h4>Article 23 — Incident Reporting</h4><p>CSOAI maps this to charter articles. The mapping is indicative and published; the signed, article-level crosswalk runs in the OS.</p></div> <h2>CSOAI Compliance Coverage</h2> <div class=\"req-box\"> <h4>Crosswalk mapping — indicative, not a determination</h4> <p>CSOAI maps NIS2 requirements to a published control set. The mapping is indicative; we enforce nothing — only a regulator can. Every mapping is published as a crosswalk. The measurement behind it is re-runnable from the published harness — we are not claiming a live consensus process.</p> </div> <div class=\"req-box\"> <h4>Signed Attestations</h4> <p>Every measurement run is signed, and its inputs are published, so anyone can recompute the result rather than trust it. Public verify URL: https://councilof.ai/gspc-verify</p> </div> <div class=\"req-box\"> <h4>The Measured Board</h4> <p>Published on the signed board: every axis with its item count and confidence interval where quotable (usable n ≥ 30) — the slot count and the measured count are published together on the live board (GET /api/gspc, totals.public_count) and are deliberately not frozen into this page. UNMEASURED cells are shown empty, never invented. Verify any card free at councilof.ai/gspc-verify.</p> </div> <h2>Get Measured</h2> <p>Run a CSOAI measurement against the EU AI Act — verification free forever.</p> <a href=\"/gspc-verify\" class=\"cta\">Run the free measurement →</a> <p class=\"foot\">© 2026 CSOAI LTD (UK 16939677) · <a href=\"/methodology\">Methodology</a> · <a href=\"/asti\">ASSTI Benchmark</a></p>",
